        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Hello everyone -&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A couple questions -&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1) Is there a way to determine how much a character can lift?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2) Is there a way to determine how fast a character can move (run, fly, etc)?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I'm curious, and it's bound to come up sooner or later!&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>",
