      {
        "id": 230779,
        "name": "catDreaming",
        "username": "catDreaming",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/4491bb/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2020-05-25T04:20:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hard mechanics wise? Nope! It's a comic, they lift as much/move as fast as the story needs them to!</p>\n<p>Soft mechanics wise? That's probably something to be determined at the table for that story. Comics are fluid, and power levels are never constant. Figure out what makes for a good story, based on what the narrative of the character says about the stats on their sheet.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:05:52.290Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
