        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Hard mechanics wise? Nope! It's a comic, they lift as much/move as fast as the story needs them to!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Soft mechanics wise? That's probably something to be determined at the table for that story. Comics are fluid, and power levels are never constant. Figure out what makes for a good story, based on what the narrative of the character says about the stats on their sheet.</p>",
